{"type":"step-attempt","step":"design","sessionId":"71cfc445-92da-442b-bd55-2630f7bef174","outcome":{"verdict":"success","findingsPath":null,"error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"reason":"design.md / spec.md / tasks.md written under specrunner/changes/halt-checkpoint-restack/ on branch change/halt-checkpoint-restack-a3a7b448. Design covers restack onto last-published tip (D1-D4, D8), journal-only checkpoint-restack record inside the published tree (D5), local branch graft to avoid a new non-fast-forward failure mode (D6), and module placement with callback-injected store effects (D7). One documented deviation from the request wording: overlay unit is the change folder rather than managed paths only, because managed-paths-only cannot satisfy acceptance criterion 2 (attach + resume) in the actual rejection topology.","status":"success"},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-22T01:33:57.943Z","endedAt":"2026-08-22T01:49:59.797Z","commitOid":"62beef0cd2c99a623070af67bb6416ce6e672671"}
